            <div xml:id="d291">

                <pb facs="0504" n="390" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg390"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15a3/1408a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawes</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-30T17:00:00-05:00">March 30, 1931—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>86. Department has thus far received incomplete information on the nature and
                    extent of the difficulties which have supervened between the French, British and
                    Italians with regard to the final terms of the naval arrangement. Please
                    ascertain as promptly as possible and inform Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
